<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8" />
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
<title>Athlete MindBoost — Support</title>
<meta name="description" content="Support, FAQ, and contact information for Athlete MindBoost." />
<style>
  :root {
    --bg: #0f172a;
    --panel: #111c34;
    --panel-2: #16223e;
    --text: #e6edf7;
    --muted: #9aa7c2;
    --accent: #7cc4ff;
    --border: rgba(255,255,255,0.08);
  }
  * { box-sizing: border-box; }
  html, body { margin: 0; padding: 0; }
  body {
    font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;
    background: radial-gradient(1200px 600px at 10% -10%, #1b2a52 0%, transparent 60%),
                radial-gradient(900px 500px at 110% 10%, #0b3a55 0%, transparent 60%),
                var(--bg);
    color: var(--text);
    line-height: 1.6;
    min-height: 100vh;
  }
  .wrap { max-width: 760px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 64px 24px 96px; }
  header { text-align: center; margin-bottom: 48px; }
  .badge {
    display: inline-block;
    padding: 6px 12px;
    border-radius: 999px;
    background: rgba(124,196,255,0.12);
    color: var(--accent);
    font-size: 13px;
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: 0.4px;
    border: 1px solid rgba(124,196,255,0.25);
    margin-bottom: 16px;
  }
  h1 { font-size: 40px; margin: 0 0 12px; letter-spacing: -0.5px; }
  .lede { color: var(--muted); font-size: 17px; margin: 0; }
  section {
    background: linear-gradient(180deg, var(--panel) 0%, var(--panel-2) 100%);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: 18px;
    padding: 28px;
    margin-bottom: 20px;
  }
  h2 { margin: 0 0 14px; font-size: 22px; letter-spacing: -0.2px; }
  p { margin: 0 0 12px; color: var(--text); }
  .muted { color: var(--muted); }
  a { color: var(--accent); text-decoration: none; font-weight: 600; }
  a:hover { text-decoration: underline; }
  .faq-item { padding: 14px 0; border-top: 1px solid var(--border); }
  .faq-item:first-child { border-top: 0; padding-top: 0; }
  .faq-q { font-weight: 600; margin-bottom: 6px; }
  .contact-btn {
    display: inline-block;
    margin-top: 8px;
    padding: 12px 18px;
    background: var(--accent);
    color: #07223a;
    border-radius: 12px;
    font-weight: 700;
  }
  .contact-btn:hover { text-decoration: none; opacity: 0.92; }
  footer { text-align: center; color: var(--muted); font-size: 13px; margin-top: 32px; }
</style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="wrap">
    <header>
      <div class="badge">SUPPORT</div>
      <h1>Athlete MindBoost</h1>
      <p class="lede">Mental performance tools for athletes. We're here to help.</p>
    </header>

    <section>
      <h2>Contact us</h2>
      <p>The fastest way to reach us is by email. We typically respond within 24–48 hours.</p>
      <a class="contact-btn" href="mailto:braden.no10@yahoo.co.uk?subject=Athlete%20MindBoost%20Support">Email support</a>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2>Frequently asked questions</h2>

      <div class="faq-item">
        <div class="faq-q">Is the app free?</div>
        <p class="muted">Yes. All core tools — confidence building, positive tracking, parent support, and the injury comeback programme — are completely free.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="faq-item">
        <div class="faq-q">Why does the app ask for microphone access?</div>
        <p class="muted">The microphone is used only for voice-based journaling and recording personal reflections. Recordings stay on your device unless you choose to share them.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="faq-item">
        <div class="faq-q">How do I enable notifications?</div>
        <p class="muted">Open Settings → Notifications → Athlete MindBoost on your device, and enable Allow Notifications. You can fine-tune reminders inside the app's Settings screen.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="faq-item">
        <div class="faq-q">How do I delete my account or data?</div>
        <p class="muted">Open the app, go to Settings, and use the account/data options to sign out or delete your data. You can also email us and we'll handle it for you.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="faq-item">
        <div class="faq-q">I found a bug — what should I do?</div>
        <p class="muted">Email us with a short description and, if possible, a screenshot and your device model. It really helps us fix things fast.</p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2>Privacy</h2>
      <p class="muted">We respect your privacy. We don't track you across other apps or websites, and we don't sell personal data. For full details, see our privacy policy in the app's Settings.</p>
    </section>

    <footer>
      © Athlete MindBoost. All rights reserved.
    </footer>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
